### Invitation API — REST Client (.http) 스크래치
### VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client / `httpie` 등에서 사용.
### 변수는 환경에 맞춰 채워주세요.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@workspaceId = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_ID
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@token = REPLACE_WITH_INVITATION_TOKEN

### 1) 초대 생성 — OWNER/ADMIN 만
POST {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 2) Pending 초대 목록 — OWNER/ADMIN 만
GET {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3) 토큰으로 초대 정보 조회 — Public (인증 불필요)
GET {{host}}/invitations/{{token}}

### 4) 초대 수락 — 인증 필요
POST {{host}}/invitations/{{token}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5) 초대 취소 — OWNER/ADMIN 만
DELETE {{host}}/invitations/{{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### -------- 검증 시나리오 --------

### 6) 권한 없는 사용자가 초대 시도 (MEMBER) → 403 기대
POST {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer MEMBER_LEVEL_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com"
}

### 7) 잘못된 이메일 → 400 (class-validator 거절)
POST {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### 8) OWNER 역할 요청 → 400 (IsIn 거절)
POST {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### 9) 같은 이메일 중복 요청 → 409 (이미 pending 존재)
POST {{host}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com"
}

### 10) 다른 이메일로 수락 시도 → 403
POST {{host}}/invitations/{{token}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer DIFFERENT_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
